   "beat_id": "B00",
   "act": "ASK",
   "narration_text": "Every vague Cowork failure traces back to a missing field. Not a model error. Not a capability limit. A missing field. The brief is the spec for the task \u2014 and a brief with seven fields turns every crash into a fixable specification. This is Liam, in for Bear.",
