   "beat_id": "B01",
   "act": "THE-CRASH",
   "narration_text": "Marcus's brief said 'summarize Q3 reports into a board document.' No year range. No specification of which financial data was in scope. No indication that the three pilot sites ran on different tracking systems. Cowork summarized what it found, presented it as complete, and the board document was wrong in three ways Marcus could not easily explain.",
